      "en": "He said to them, “Please hear this dream which I have dreamed:",
      "ko": "요셉이 그들에게 이르되 청컨대 나의 꾼 꿈을 들으시오",
      "source_text_hash": "27653bb2488eeb43a910eeb3163c2e1280aa0a3041108013810fe5c4bf43bfb6",
      "translation_text_hash": "7d8708c51044d193aa5db8e7e18654ab5c44af252a0fe107674d851370c12ebe",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "요셉이 그들에게 이르되 청컨대 나의 꾼 꿈을 들으시오"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "7d8708c51044d193aa5db8e7e18654ab5c44af252a0fe107674d851370c12ebe"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:GEN:37:7",
      "sequence": 1091,
