      "en": "All his sons and all his daughters rose up to comfort him, but he refused to be comforted. He said, “For I will go down to Sheol to my son, mourning.” His father wept for him.",
      "ko": "그 모든 자녀가 위로하되 그가 그 위로를 받지 아니하여 가로되 내가 슬퍼하며 음부에 내려 아들에게로 가리라 하고 그 아비가 그를 위하여 울었더라",
      "source_text_hash": "af913cd611902b97204b5e9a20df5d78e6e0b7137693fb4aea717b2b05e9283b",
      "translation_text_hash": "fe0df483e7bf52d85db82f3e6f9d95671d797d82707642b07e4e93831513222f",
